{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_04_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1084205972d45b20f6e80f37579fe732b64279d30fb1fd469e966addbfad77eb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1431c9610414b33b3d05bf085aaad1237bcb9e2e2ca24ff781b29c6468f6c44f",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？我们一走进来，\n周围就开始骚动起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3203ba35eb16f3100f337f7a8178a4d29bcb65890dc836b4172c73c68cb8c73e",
      "text": "毕竟看起来没有其他从不良少年转行做偶像的参赛者嘛。\n我们的打扮很罕见吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35aea8cf934ac01020076f790829d25f8448c75e9dd8bb63373008364aad46fc",
      "text": "嘿……话说回来，\n居然有这么多参赛者啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e328809095f32d463af532031d493e352c3110842e0cb0c42d52635e5941405",
      "text": "（嗯？朱雀这家伙……好像很紧张啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deaed1d081cdcf9ff7d16f3a41d34ec967d81d4f0eae585d9f512352ff2ee4ad",
      "text": "嘿嘿，正合我意。\n不给他们露一手怎么行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dda69ebfce2b4839e36d47b0ea78bec27c687ab2edbd5200f7009a17e62dc914",
      "text": "（……呵。比平时还要有干劲啊。\n刚才那是所谓的临阵兴奋发抖吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534f8b6d55316ad2d6932b142091e73ce43b2d7e2bc8ca0d52b09c0feb38bebf",
      "text": "这次是多家事务所联合举办的试镜。\n拿出真本事让评审员眼前一亮吧，相棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf528164c5d3d66895700e201178b838adf55203ed802c4aefdd724d1596c401",
      "text": "噢！大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069375834c9df71a079431b991eadd9cef4a1f9960c8ac589adf6c228c1124ef",
      "text": "（即便在这么多人之中，\n朱雀先生和玄武先生依然格外引人注目……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41299d5a2f2a307f8af69480addd67e687146c6c41c6733c78106bd95fd2397f",
      "text": "那么，首先请做自我介绍。\n之后请紧接着展示特长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16003d236c5aea85d9daee6c4362fcaea1bcb704df6f7b075a338ea2089e6d9c",
      "text": "不好意思。红井先生和黑野先生，\n请两位一起进行自我介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04b427dd18b29bd0735bc4621286fd4d9411b1f1ed419cef6dc0f58d22ff7f34",
      "text": "我是红井朱雀。\n然后，这是喵喜威。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65bd418e5dc129c9168d6347dc72829c18583c730add2c6fe4cab3c7f636ec2d",
      "text": "我是黑野玄武。我们是为了消灭世上的邪恶\n而以偶像为目标的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7782852859f88636ecefe11e34822094897c93f256ec2d41035ae8cd79c2de0e",
      "text": "所以，这就是我们的必杀技。\n上吧，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:735c32eb25bc3618b73db27c95d94b52fa5169f53f005095b755ea4909bb20f2",
      "text": "燃烧起来吧！\n必杀！天空朱雀落！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86804f7a34a2d5cc1a835dcfed6cadbbcb38f5bb7a6c0cb48349edf623be5f13",
      "text": "刮目相看吧！\n必杀！天玄冰刃波！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
